agent-browser, vendored into raea from https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser at commit dac13bb (version 0.39.1,
2026-10-15), Apache-2.0 (LICENSE beside this file). Only cli/ is kept (its tests/ removed), plus an empty
packages/dashboard/out/ that its build script expects.

raea's changes, all in cli/:
- src/lib.rs (new): the crate's modules as a library, so raea-browser runs the daemon's command execution in process.
- Cargo.toml: `autobins = false`, a `[lib]` section, an empty `[workspace]` (it builds on its own inside raea), and
  the release profiles removed (the host workspace sets them).
Nothing else is modified.
